# Cross-confirm twin of mode_42t.script: the same route with circle and cross swapped
# (0x2000 <-> 0x4000), because with EMOTIONALSENSE_CONFIRM=cross the host's cross is the
# game's confirm. Run it with --confirm cross.
# PLAY MODE SELECT -> fourth item (4.2T) -> FreeStyle list -> song.
# The item is locked in a save that never unlocked it; the game only sets
# bit 5 of the u16 at 0x134960 when the mode is earned.
400:4000:5
460:0008:5
@1+60:0008:5
@1+550:0020:5
@1+610:0020:5
@1+670:0020:5
@1+850:4000:5
@1+950:0020:5
@1+1010:0020:5
@1+1070:0020:5
@1+1130:0020:5
@1+1250:4000:5
